# Generated by scripts/build-fumola-wasm.sh, and not committed.
#
# The canonical runtime is published to GitHub Pages from the Fumola repo, at
# https://adapton.github.io/fumola/ , and the page falls back to it whenever
# these are absent. Committing a build here instead would put a 5MB binary in
# the branch preview directory, which is what made GitHub Pages fail to build
# the whole hazelgrove/build site.
src/web/www/fumola/
